  "package_root_hash": "33ccc4af31e9a33187aa2709588fa8a77135ac91a7b5f0d959f963cbbcdba1bb",
  "recorded_from": "the package's own bytes, not a build: this record was written for a package that was already committed without one. Every variant was put through what a carried-forward sibling is put through \u2014 the bytes in the package, the architecture its own header declares, and every string literal of built_from inside it \u2014 and the fields only the building machine could know are null. Repackaging any variant with cmake --build build-basecamp -j8 && module/package-basecamp.sh build-basecamp replaces its entry with a real build's.",
